  "plain": "A surgeon named Italo Venturelli, speaking on podcast host Jesse Michels' show, says that in January 1996 people in the Brazilian town of Varginha saw a craft being shot down. According to him, someone fired on it and it was already falling when it got there, and he says a young man named Carlos de Souza will tell you so himself. If true, it would mean someone deliberately brought down an unknown craft over Brazil."
